                        "sense_id": "8616d23d-48af-344e-808f-5628a4e4b1f2",
                        "entry_id": "794857e0-aba3-345d-be73-9e8f72261b80",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to feel sad"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "03b18049-eb87-47d7-935e-1f86e46c9b78",
                                "sense_id": "8616d23d-48af-344e-808f-5628a4e4b1f2",
                                "text": "А́нниньке опя́ть взгрустну́лось: ей показа́лось, что слова́ Феду́лыча звуча́т иро́нией.",
                                "translation": "Anninka again felt sad: she sensed there was irony in what Fedulych said.",
                                "english": "Anninka again felt sad: she sensed there was irony in what Fedulych said."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
